{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04786","headline":"岳州夜坐 · 张说","name":"岳州夜坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎洲苦三伏，永日卧孤城。\n赖此闲庭夜，萧条夜月明。\n独歌还太息，幽感见余声。\n江近鹤时呌，山深猿屡鸣。\n息心观有欲，弃知返无名。\n五十知天命，吾其达此生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}